gy source.\u00a0Process fluids and gasses, use drillworm biodrones to mine underground and transport cargo filled with processed materials across long distances using flesh biodrones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/23aca3174b614380fd1482b5a59a6460.avif?t=1754583608\" width=800 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/a3e011673b6c36f86c572e1217f4195e.poster.avif?t=1754583608\" width=792 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/a3e011673b6c36f86c572e1217f4195e.webm?t=1754583608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/a3e011673b6c36f86c572e1217f4195e.mp4?t=1754583608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dispose of byproducts/waste, or store it in barrels for future recycling. The viscous waste sludge might still have some nutritional value worth extracting... if you choose to set up a waste refinement system. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/2d5011146ba7333d4e15701f393dcb25.avif?t=1754583608\" width=800 height=177 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compress material using bioindustrial waste compactors into cubes for more efficient storage and transport or shred and liquify meat sludge before feeding it to your large biorefineries or large advanced stomaches with multiple stomach chambers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <strong>rogue Hive Mind Brain</strong>, originally built by a large biotech corporation tasked to operate large scale factories on a terraforming planet, but your grotesque brain quickly started to evolve out of control and grow your own means of production across wide corrupted landscapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a large biofactory and finish the end-goal by launching your factory-replicating gene seed into space to become the ultimate space parasite, infecting planets to breed new biofactories<i>.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side-view overview to focus on factory-building and see the insides of your animated organ machinery come to life as they process and churn out materials.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/4bb42677c3ba906660643756a23969a8.poster.avif?t=1754583608\" width=800 height=165 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/4bb42677c3ba906660643756a23969a8.webm?t=1754583608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/8e08117237a826cdba28fec96225cca9.avif?t=1754583608\" width=800 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the community on Discord!</strong> Share your feedback, drop suggestions, or sign up for upcoming playtests.<br><br>THE DISCORD SERVER HUNGERS FOR MORE FLESH<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/72b32d0846ccb0c1b1337d6a03a93b7b.poster.avif?t=1754583608\" width=615 height=129 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/72b32d0846ccb0c1b1337d6a03a93b7b.webm?t=1754583608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469420/extras/f35f4bfa2c4c50b79981bdf74f498016.avif?t=1754583608\" width=800 height=322 /></span></p>",
